	(text "PWMn = PWMn_M AND HEALTHY (16), EN = EN_M AND HEALTHY, K_PRE = K_PRE_M AND HEALTHY, K_A/K_B = K_x_M AND\nKGATE, STATUS_L = STATUS_M AND HEALTHY, FAN_PWM_L = FAN_PWM_M AND BIAS_EN (PV-PWR rule: fans only while the\ngate bias loads the aux supply). The power board pulls every PC input low (10k / 100k)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 159.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0aeb2eac-d74d-55be-93b3-ed64a78fd198")
	)
	(text "74LVC07 (Ioff, 5 V tolerant): OC_N, OVT_N, FLT_N (driver DESAT/UVLO + port OC of PV-PWR), RDY (gate supplies,\n+5V, live 24 V on PV-PWR), STOP_OK (ENABLE), WD_OK (heartbeat and MCU reset). Any low -> PRE_N low ->\nlatch set asynchronously (Q = TRIP = 1). The MCU reads PRE_N on GPIO17 (rev A2, diagnosis only)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 66.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2f66e564-2095-5c99-a29f-557da9541c97")
	)
	(text "B = HEARTBEAT (rising edges from the control ISR, >= 500 Hz), A = GND, CLR = XRSn. Q = WD_OK stays high\nwhile edges come faster than tw = 49.9k x 100n (4.7-5.8 ms); no edge, a stuck pin or any MCU reset (XRSn low)\n-> WD_OK low -> latch. Rext to VCC, Cext between Cext and Rext/Cext (SCES586E table 4-1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.136 59.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "478ebee9-61cb-534a-83b3-3f9706a23807")
	)
	(text "CONTACTOR GATE: KGATE = HEALTHY OR HOLD (74LVC1G32)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 443.336 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "49f0c0e6-3e3d-50e1-be05-cbdd697a6877")
	)
	(text "PRE = PRE_N, CLR tied high, D = GND, CLK = LATCH_CLR (GPIO24). A firmware rising edge loads 0 (clears)\nonly while PRE_N is high (no source active); with any source active PRE wins (Table 8-1). Q = TRIP\n(red LED, INPUTXBAR1 -> TZ1), /Q = HEALTHY (gates). Unpowered: Ioff -> HEALTHY reads 0 (100k)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 141.784 63.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4da95577-d5a1-505a-b8b3-b897033f2f8e")
	)
	(text "POWER-BOARD STATUS LINES (PV-PWR AS BUILT)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 435.656 79.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "503d8d40-2313-565a-bab5-a13f6e37e38a")
	)
	(text "THE LATCH (74LVC1G74, SET-DOMINANT)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 141.784 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "51c45760-7a41-562d-987f-5e899dc1cafc")
	)
	(text "TRIP SOURCES -> PRE_N (OPEN-DRAIN WIRED-AND, 4.7K TO +3V3)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "78f3d4e9-ed50-5f99-96b3-50e2e49b9617")
	)
	(text "FLT_N: open drain on PV-PWR, pulled up HERE (4.99k, PV-PWR recommendation). RDY: open drain pulled up on\nPV-PWR (no pull-up here, 100k pull-down allowed), to the MCU via 1k. HOLD push-pull, MOV_OK open drain\nwith 10k on PV-PWR: 100k pull-downs define an unplugged cable (not held / monitor open)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 435.656 142.544 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7e758063-88f8-5150-b3ad-e96e7aeaf016")
	)
	(text "HEARTBEAT WATCHDOG (74LVC1G123)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.136 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8a5a8a95-745b-5901-88af-0a8123c61c6d")
	)
	(text "A trip drops K_PRE at once, but K_A / K_B only while HOLD is low: while the power board holds a contactor\n(port current above its breaking limit) this board never commands it open; the power board's coil\ninterlock enforces the same. Closing still needs the MCU command AND (HEALTHY OR HOLD)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 443.336 59.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9f9c5f43-189d-5807-8b55-3fab957eff72")
	)
	(text "GATING: 6 X 74LVC08 (22 GATES USED, 2 SPARE WITH INPUTS GROUNDED)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 79.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e067547b-ee6c-57d3-90a2-27033a599bd7")
	)
